{
  "description": "Shared test cases for matching a plugin manifest's sdkVersion against the SDK version of ECore and of the shell (docs/plugins/sdk-v0.md, Versioning). npm semver semantics: ^ allows changes that do not modify the left-most non-zero part; ~ allows patch changes; >= is open-ended; a bare version must match exactly. Prerelease versions match only an exact range. Both ECore and the shell must pass every case.",
